comment.narrative:
The PFS takes part in coordination meetings of the food security cluster, the Cash working group (CWG) bringing together all the actors involved in social safety net programs. Furthermore, the project is a very active stakeholder in the development processes o repositories as is the case of:
&nbsp; - Protocol on monetary transfers which defines the obligations of stakeholders, the pr inciples, conditions and modalities of intervention in terms of monetary transfers to poor and vulnerable people in Burkina Faso;
& nbsp; - National program to support the empowerment of poor and vulnerable households in Burkina Faso (PAMPV), as a programmatic approach which should ultimately bring together all cash plus interventions in Burkina Faso.
